[Workspace development](Workspace-Development.lingua) owns scheduling. These Records preserve the former plans as detailed contracts and whole-workflow acceptance joins. They are not a serial implementation backlog. Each Record links its contributing feature packages; their full task text and real prerequisite graph live there.

