## Conversion coverage

All original task and requirement identifiers are retained. 05.T04 is partitioned into shared source/layer delivery and its geographic application; 11.T01 is partitioned into generic joint/assembly relations and exact-solid operations. The full parent text remains in its contract, and both clauses must pass before the parent closes. No other task has multiple implementation owners. Historical fixture evidence is preserved, with links corrected for the moved directory. A missing original supporting document remains explicitly unavailable rather than silently invented.
